WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:09.073
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:12.531
What do they see?

3
00:00:12.532 --> 00:00:18.704
They see a minigolf course.

4
00:00:18.705 --> 00:00:27.972
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:27.973 --> 00:00:58.391
They go to a bridge.

6
00:00:58.392 --> 00:01:24.460
They go to an igloo.

7
00:01:24.461 --> 00:01:41.996
They go to a castle.

8
00:01:41.997 --> 00:01:57.563
They go to a windmill.

9
00:01:57.564 --> 00:02:10.034
They go to a rocket.

10
00:02:10.035 --> 00:02:16.743
The rocket blasts off!

11
00:02:16.744 --> 00:02:21.037
Blobs, where are you going?

12
00:02:21.038 --> 00:02:28.441
They go to space!

13
00:02:28.442 --> 00:02:33.255
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:33.256 --> 00:02:36.880
Good-bye!

